{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-conflict","title":"组织冲突","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-conflict","title":"团队冲突管理 Team Conflict Management","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/team-conflict","wordCount":3435,"readingTime":14},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-department","title":"跨部门冲突 Cross-departmental Conflict","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/cross-department","wordCount":3507,"readingTime":15},{"seq":3,"slug":"leadership-conflict","title":"领导力与冲突 Leadership and Conflict","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/leadership-conflict","wordCount":3723,"readingTime":15}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"组织冲突\">组织冲突</h1><p>组织冲突是企业运营中最常见也最消耗资源的管理挑战之一。从团队内部的角色摩擦到跨部门的资源竞争，从战略方向的分歧到权力结构的博弈，组织冲突的形态多样且影响深远。</p>\n<p>本章聚焦三个关键场景：团队冲突管理探讨如何在保持团队凝聚力的同时激发建设性分歧；跨部门冲突分析组织结构和流程设计对冲突的影响及系统性解决方案；领导力与冲突则关注管理者如何在冲突中发挥引导和转化作用，将冲突转化为组织学习和创新的驱动力。</p>\n"}